The mermaid_core and mermaid_flutter packages contain code derived from
mermaid.js (https://github.com/mermaid-js/mermaid), which is MIT licensed.

The mermaid_core and elk packages vendor derivatives of dart_dagre (Apache
License 2.0) under their respective lib/src directories; those directories
retain the original license.

The mermaid_core package embeds KaTeX fonts for math rendering. The fonts are
licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
(https://github.com/KaTeX/KaTeX/blob/main/src/fonts/OFL.txt); "KaTeX" is a
reserved font name.
